{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.FluidDynamics.p1_spectral_sobolev","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.p1_spectral_sobolev","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Ring.Basic"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.p1_spectral_sobolev","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.p1_spectral_sobolev","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/p1_spectral_sobolev.lean#L53-L69","doc":"**Discrete spectrum + Sobolev embedding** ([`prop:p1-spectral-sobolev`]).\n\n(a) the spectrum is increasing and non-negative — *derived* from the\neigenvalue formula and `q`-integer monotonicity (`mul_self_le_mul_self`\n/ `mul_self_nonneg`); (b) restates the spectral computation; (c)\nrestates the Sobolev input. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:q-spectral-sobolev","label":"prop:q-spectral-sobolev","md":"quantum-observable-universe/fluid-dynamics/p1-spectral-sobolev.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext.sobolev_embedding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext.sobolev_embedding","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/p1_spectral_sobolev.lean#L51-L51","doc":"**(c) — the analytic input:** Sobolev embedding bound\n`‖f‖_{L^∞} ≤ C_S · ‖f‖_{H¹_q}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext.Linf_norm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext.Linf_norm","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/p1_spectral_sobolev.lean#L48-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext.H1_norm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext.H1_norm","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/p1_spectral_sobolev.lean#L47-L47","doc":"`H¹_q`- and `L^∞`-norms of an arbitrary test function. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext.C_S","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext.C_S","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/p1_spectral_sobolev.lean#L45-L45","doc":"Sobolev embedding constant `C_S` for `H¹_q ↪ L^∞`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext.eigenvalue_formula","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext.eigenvalue_formula","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/p1_spectral_sobolev.lean#L43-L43","doc":"**(b) — the spectral computation:** eigenvalue closed form\n`μ_k = [k]_q²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext.μ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext.μ","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/p1_spectral_sobolev.lean#L40-L40","doc":"The discrete `q`-Laplacian eigenvalues `μ_k`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext.q_int_mono","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext.q_int_mono","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/p1_spectral_sobolev.lean#L38-L38","doc":"The `q`-integers increase in `k` (holds for `q > 1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext.q_int_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext.q_int_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/p1_spectral_sobolev.lean#L36-L36","doc":"The `q`-integers are non-negative (holds for `q > 1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext.q_int","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext.q_int","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/p1_spectral_sobolev.lean#L34-L34","doc":"The `q`-integer `[k]_q = (q^k − q^{−k})/(q − q^{−1})`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/p1_spectral_sobolev.lean#L32-L32","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.FluidDynamics.P1SpectralSobolevContext","kind":"class","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/FluidDynamics/p1_spectral_sobolev.lean#L28-L51","doc":"Hypotheses for the discrete spectrum + Sobolev embedding (§7c:\ngeneric linearly ordered `CommRing` (`IsStrictOrderedRing`), no `ℝ`).  (b) and the `q`-integer\nmonotonicity are the genuine inputs; the spectrum ordering (a) is\n*derived* in `p1_spectral_sobolev`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}